used version\n\nF8: SDK 10.0.401 rejects the former bare leading-zero version with only\nMSB4181, not \"is not a valid version string\", so the check no longer depends\non SDK error text. It uses a differential control against one probe project\nand one feed holding the letter-prefixed package: the valid version must\nrestore; a well-formed absent version must fail with a NU110x resolution\ndiagnostic (proving the SDK reports parsed versions); the former version must\nfail restore with no NU110x diagnostic, no resolved probe package, and either\nthe explicit invalid-version text or MSB4181. The probe SDK version is logged.\n\nA6: the PostgreSQL harness assigns version and mutant_version exactly once,\nand --print-candidate-version reports those assignments (override included)\nafter the same head/derivation path. The check rejects extra assignment\nstatements and runs the real harness under a dotnet stub that captures the\nfirst -p:PackageVersion, which must equal the printed derivation for HEAD.\nHarness mutants: bare prefix derivation, bare version line, reassignment\nafter the required line, late read reassignment, and a late eval\nreassignment caught only by the captured restore version.\n\nA5: dcb_template_validation.yml pull_request paths include the PostgreSQL\nharness; workflow-source validation requires that path and the version-check\ninvocation, with a mutant for each.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f359366fecd51e16fc34b246fb043ff300e02573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/J-Tech-Japan/Sekiban/git/trees/f359366fecd51e16fc34b246fb043ff300e02573"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/J-Tech-Japan/Sekiban/git/commits/aefca245bdd4010b537657793eaa041c9c83d9c8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/J-Tech-Japan/Sekiban/commits/aefca245bdd4010b537657793eaa041c9c83d9c8","html_url":"https://github.com